  {
   TEXT 
"This is the common load word (that encodes\n"+
" the width of the pulse on the output of \n"+
" one of 4 phases). It goes to the arrays from a \n"+
" load register written to by the software. It is not\n"+
" from the load controllers.\n"+
"\n"+
"The \"ld\" control is actually the OR'd combination of the \n"+
" outputs of each of the 4 load controllers for this phase's\n"+
" array."
   RECT (220,1160,943,1459)
   MARGINS (1,1)
   COLOR (0,0,0)
   FONT (12,0,0,400,0,0,0,"Arial")
